\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\s30\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls6\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10895145\contextualspace \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 Absolutely. Here is }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 Chapter One}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 
 for your quantum-bureaucratic novel with Neville Wren as the protagonist and }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 Quentin Edmund Darling}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436  as the byline.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\s30\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls6\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10895145\contextualspace {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs36\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 Chapter One
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs27 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\s30\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls6\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10895145\contextualspace {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs27 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs27\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 
The Form That Would Not Resolve
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\s30\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls6\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10895145\contextualspace {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 
There are, in the management of large and failing systems, certain sounds one learns to distrust.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
The metallic cough of a heating vent in late November, for instance, which means either nothing at all or a catastrophe in the wall. The tiny, clerical thump of an internal memorandum landing in the inbox, which means either lunch has been moved to Wednes
day or civilization has. And then there was the particular soft clicking noise made by the complaint terminal on Neville Wren\rquote s desk when it had decided, in its own limited but vindictive fashion, that the morning was not going to proceed properly.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville looked up from his tea.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
This was unfortunate for two reasons. The first was that he had not yet had enough of it to be tolerant. The second was that the tea itself, purchased in a spirit of optimism from a machine on the fourth floor, had the colour and emotional range of varnis
hed disappointment.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}The terminal clicked again.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Neville sighed in the manner of a man who had once trained in theoretical physics and now worked in Transit Reconciliation, which is rather like having spent one\rquote 
s youth studying celestial harmony only to discover that the stars have all gone into local government.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-144\li144\ri0\sl259\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin144\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid4407492 \page 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\s30\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls6\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10895145\contextualspace \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 
His office, if such a term may be generously applied to a room with one window, four filing stacks, and the temperament of a damp envelope, occupied the far end of the Regional Transit Reconciliation Annex. The Annex itself had been designed in the late b
ureaucratic style, meaning that it was thought to promote openness while in fact promoting fluorescent headaches. People came there to complain about missed connections, duplicate arrivals, incorrect departures, luggage with philosophical objections to ow
nership, and, increasingly over the last several months, journeys that had happened in the wrong order.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville had processed three of those this week.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He did not care for trends in metaphysics.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
The terminal emitted a third click, sharper this time, followed by the appearance of a new case file on the screen.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}COMPLAINT TYPE: TRANSIT DISCREPANCY\line SUBCATEGORY: PREMATURE ARRIVAL / INTENT LAG\line CITIZEN STATUS: PRESENT
\line URGENCY: MODERATE TO EXISTENTIAL
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville stared at the final line.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Then he took another sip of tea in the vain hope that liquid might alter the meaning of language.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}It did not.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
There came a brisk knock at the open office door, immediately followed by a woman entering without waiting for permission, which in Neville\rquote 
s experience generally indicated either authority or age. In this case, it was age wielded with such competence that it had become authority on its own.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
She was in her late sixties, perhaps early seventies, with silver hair pinned back in a way that suggested she had no intention of adjusting it for the convenience of reality. She wore a dark coat, sensible shoes, and the expression of a woman who had onc
e accepted the collapse of standards in public life as regrettable but had no intention of accepting the collapse of space-time.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Mr Wren?\'94 she said.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Neville Wren, yes.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Good. I\rquote ve been sent from Admissions.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}This was never good.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville gestured to the chair opposite his desk. \'93Please sit down.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}She sat with the composure of someone settling in for a procedure that should have been unnecessary.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Elspeth Chain,\'94 she said. \'93Mrs Elspeth Chain, technically, though I\rquote ve found that \lquote Mrs
\rquote  invites a certain tone from public institutions and I\rquote d rather avoid it.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93That seems wise,\'94 said Neville.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Mrs Chain nodded once, as if pleased that one civil servant in the building had not entirely wasted his upbringing.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville brought up the file. \'93You\rquote ve reported a transit discrepancy.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93I have.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He glanced down. \'93Premature arrival with intent lag.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Yes.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville folded his hands. \'93I wonder if you might explain what happened in your own words.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Mrs Chain did not answer immediately. Instead she removed her gloves, placed them side by side in her lap with the care of a woman whose self-command was holding back a very great deal, and said, \'93
I set out this morning to visit my sister in Whitbury-on-Sea.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville nodded.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93I had not,\'94 she continued, \'93fully decided to go.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville paused. \'93I see.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93
No, Mr Wren, that is rather the problem. I had not fully decided to go, but I had advanced sufficiently in the direction of deciding that I put on my coat, found my umbrella, and went to the bus stop in order, so to speak, to think transitively.\'94

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville regarded her. \'93Transitively.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Yes. It often helps.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Of course.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93It was drizzling,\'94 said Mrs Chain.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Was it?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93
At home, yes. At the bus stop, less so. Halfway through the route it became bright, then windy, then, for one very unpleasant stretch near the old post office, maritime.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Maritime.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93There were gulls.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville made a note.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain went on. \'93
I was still deciding whether I wished to spend the afternoon with my sister when the bus stopped, the doors opened, and I found I had already arrived.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93That seems, on the face of it, efficient.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain gave him a look which suggested that if he continued in that vein she might improve him physically. \'93
Mr Wren,\'94 she said, \'93Whitbury-on-Sea is twelve miles from my house. I had not committed to the journey. I had not, internally speaking, agreed to it. One ought not to arrive anywhere before one has properly consented to the inconvenience.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93No,\'94 said Neville quietly. \'93One oughtn\rquote t.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Quite.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He glanced at the screen again. The file now read:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}STATUS: APPROVED\line RESOLUTION: PASSENGER DELIVERED SUCCESSFULLY
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville frowned.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Then, before his eyes, it changed.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}STATUS: MISROUTED\line RESOLUTION: PASSENGER ARRIVED WITHOUT COMPLETED INTENTION
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Then it changed again.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}STATUS: CLOSED\line RESOLUTION: NO TRANSIT EVENT DETECTED
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville did not move for several seconds.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}The file waited, smugly.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain observed him. \'93That isn\rquote t encouraging, is it.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93No,\'94 he said. \'93Not especially.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He pressed the refresh key. The screen flickered and returned to the first status.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}APPROVED.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He pressed it again.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}MISROUTED.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Again.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}CLOSED.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
There are moments in office life when one has to decide whether a problem is technical, personal, or metaphysical. The correct answer is often all three, but procedure requires a degree of optimism.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville chose technical first.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93I\rquote m sure,\'94 he said, with the restrained falsity of a trained employee, \'93
that this is simply a processing irregularity.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain looked at the screen. \'93Is that why it keeps changing its mind?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Possibly.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93And is that common?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93No.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Good,\'94 she said. \'93I dislike being reassured with uncommon things.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville reached for a pencil.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Most officers in Transit Reconciliation used regulation pens because they were permanent, authoritative, and chained to the desk, much like the officers. Neville preferred pencil. Pencil admitted the possibility of error, which in his view placed it moral
ly above most institutions.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}In the margin of the printed complaint slip he wrote:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 |journey\\
rangle = a|not\\ yet\\ taken\\rangle + b|already\\ arrived\\rangle}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He stopped, considered, and added:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}with }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 a}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436  and }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 b}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436  being annoyingly nonzero.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain leaned slightly forward. \'93What\rquote s that?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville covered the page with professional reflex. \'93Nothing official.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93It\rquote s mathematics.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93It is a private habit.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Is it useful?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Not always,\'94 said Neville. \'93But it occasionally stops me shouting.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain accepted this at once. \'93Sensible.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}On the ceiling, the office speaker made a soft ping.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}A voice of cultivated female neutrality announced, \'93
Attention staff. Due to the implementation of the Simplification Initiative, all departments are reminded that duplicate interpretations of public events create avoidable confusion. Please encourage outc
omes to settle promptly. Thank you for supporting a clearer tomorrow.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville looked up.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain looked up.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}The speaker, having made its contribution to civilization, remained silent.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Did that seem odd to you?\'94 she asked.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Very.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Good.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93It used the phrase \lquote encourage outcomes,\rquote \'94 said Neville.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93I heard it.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93You can\rquote t encourage outcomes.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain gave him a dry look. \'93Everything in this building appears to encourage outcomes.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}That, Neville felt, was unpleasantly fair.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
He turned back to the terminal and opened the transit record in detail. A route map appeared, though it was not behaving in a route-like manner. The line representing Mrs Chain\rquote 
s bus journey seemed to have split in three places and doubled back through a district which, unless Neville was badly mistaken, had been a municipal duck pond until last February.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He zoomed in.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}The map reconfigured itself.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Whitbury-on-Sea moved three streets inland.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville blinked.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Then the little sea icon beside the town name vanished altogether and was replaced with a notation reading COASTAL STATUS: LEGACY.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain was watching him.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93What is it now?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville hesitated. Civil service etiquette discouraged alarming the public before lunch. \'93How attached,\'94
 he asked carefully, \'93would you say Whitbury is to the sea?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain stared at him. \'93It is in the name.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Yes.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Very attached.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Quite.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Why?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville turned the screen very slightly in her direction. Mrs Chain adjusted her spectacles and read the notation.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}There was a small silence.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Then she said, in a voice made sharp by disbelief, \'93What does \lquote legacy\rquote  sea mean?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93I haven\rquote t the faintest idea.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Can seas be legacy?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93They ought not to be.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Yes,\'94 she said. \'93That was my own view.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Neville printed the file. This took much longer than it should have, because the printer on his floor had been designed to detect urgency and resent it. When the sheet finally emerged, it came out warm and faintly humming, which was unusual unless a docum
ent was either very recent or very nervous.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He flattened it on the desk.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Across the bottom margin, in type too small to have been there a moment earlier, appeared a sentence he was quite certain had not existed in the record before:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}DESTINATION UPDATED TO NEAREST STABLE VERSION.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville read it twice.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain read it once and said, \'93That sounds appalling.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Yes,\'94 he said.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93And what does it mean?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He chose his words with care. \'93
I believe it means the system considers the place you went to sufficiently similar to the place you intended.\'94
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-144\li144\ri0\sl259\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin144\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
