\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\s30\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls6\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10895145\contextualspace \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 Mrs Chain drew herself up. \'93A sister is not sufficiently similar to a seaside town.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93No.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Nor is a town without a sea sufficiently similar to itself.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93No.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}She folded her gloves again. \'93Well. I\rquote m glad we agree on fundamentals.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville looked back at the terminal. The file was changing once more.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}APPROVED.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}MISROUTED.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}CLOSED.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}APPROVED.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}The statuses cycled with a kind of clerical impatience, as if the machine itself wished he would stop noticing.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
He opened his bottom drawer and took out a thin green notebook labelled, in his own hand, PRIVATE / UNHELPFUL. It contained several pages of equations, four pages of complaints about the new software, and one pressed bus ticket from a journey that had tak
en place twice but only on alternate Tuesdays.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He wrote:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}If a citizen may arrive before deciding, then decision and arrival are no longer properly ordered.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Then beneath it:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}If place may be updated to nearest stable version, then location is no longer being treated as factual.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Then, after a moment:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}This is going to become a row.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain watched the pencil move. \'93You\rquote re worried.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville closed the notebook. \'93I\rquote m employed.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Yes,\'94 she said, \'93but are you worried?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He considered the matter honestly. \'93I wasn\rquote t,\'94 he said, \'93until the sea became historical.\'94

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain stood. \'93Excellent.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93I beg your pardon?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93I prefer an official who begins worried. It saves time.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville stood as well, mostly because it seemed rude not to. \'93Mrs Chain, I\rquote ll need to escalate this.\'94

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93To whom?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
He almost laughed, which would have been unprofessional and also inaccurate, because there was no one in the building to whom one escalated anything with confidence. One merely moved trouble into a higher room and waited.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93I\rquote m not yet sure,\'94 he said.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}As if in answer, there came from the corridor the sound of running.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
This alone was alarming. People did not run in the Annex unless the kitchen had reopened unexpectedly or the laws of existence were behaving in a manner likely to reflect badly on management.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-144\li144\ri0\sl259\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin144\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
