\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 A figure appeared at the door: a narrow young man from Internal Intake, breathless and carrying a stack of forms with all the dignity of someone trying not to admit the forms were winning.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Wren,\'94 he said.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville straightened. \'93Yes?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93You\rquote ve got the Chain file?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Yes.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Don\rquote t close it.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93I hadn\rquote t planned to.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Good.\'94 The young man swallowed. \'93Three more just came in.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Three more what?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93
Premature arrivals. One man reached a funeral before the deceased had committed. A woman in Clerken Rise got off the tram and found she\rquote 
d already had lunch tomorrow. And somebody in East Wexham has reported commuting home to a house listed as an equivalent residence unit.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain, still by the chair, said very distinctly, \'93An what.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}The young man looked as if he wished to be elsewhere, preferably in a different branch of causality. \'93
Equivalent residence unit,\'94 he repeated. \'93It\rquote s on the paperwork.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville felt something cold settle in the centre of his thoughts.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Who issued the classification?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
The young man held up one of the forms. Across the top, in a new departmental font Neville already despised, were the words:
