\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville took the paper.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}For a moment the office seemed to become very still. Even the terminal stopped clicking, which was somehow worse.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Mrs Chain spoke first.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Mr Wren,\'94 she said, \'93is someone altering the world on purpose?\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Neville looked from the form to the flickering complaint file, to the private notebook on his desk, to the pale and panting messenger in the doorway, and at last back to Mrs Chain, who had arrived somewhere before deciding to go there and now seemed, quit
e reasonably, to require a grown man to explain the universe.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}He wished very much that the tea had been better.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93I sincerely hope not,\'94 he said.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Then the terminal clicked again.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}A new line appeared across the screen in bright administrative blue:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}CASE ESCALATED.\line PLEASE REPORT TO QUEUE MANAGEMENT.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville stared at it.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}There are few phrases in government more sinister than Queue Management. Most of them are longer.
