\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 Mrs Chain picked up her handbag. \'93Well,\'94 she said, \'93that sounds dreadful.\'94
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Neville reached for his coat.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s30 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16664436\charrsid16664436 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}\'93Yes,\'94 he said. \'93I rather think it does.\'94
