\par \'93Has anyone,\'94 Jago asked, \'93ever voluntarily read a listener\rquote s guide to harp moderation.\'94
\par \'93No,\'94 said Beatrix. \'93It\rquote s decorative literacy.\'94
\par Neville wrote the phrase down immediately.
\par Then he crossed to the kitchen, drawn by some instinct of domestic triage.
\par There, too, things were nearly right and therefore unbearable. The kettle was stainless steel instead of enamel. The tea caddy had been labelled }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid2375315\charrsid2375315 
