\par "Yes," said de Br\'e9
vanne quietly. "Now. On Weinstein's account, that is loose talk. On his account there was no fact about the flowers at all until the agreement reached them, and what you felt in that room was a metaphor." He turned. "But you did not writ
e down a metaphor, Mr Wren. You wrote down a mechanism. You said the lie }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid13179129\charrsid13179129 required electricity.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid13179129\charrsid13179129 "

