ery possible configuration the house might have had, including the ones it did not have. And suppose the actual configuration is }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid13179129\charrsid13179129 guided}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
