\ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid2584713\charrsid2584713 exactly equivalent}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid2584713\charrsid2584713 
 to a theory without gravity living on its edge. Two descriptions. Same physics. Neither one more real."
\par Neville sat completely still.
\par "Then the ledger isn't inside it," he said.
\par "That is what I came to say."
\par "The record of what fell in \emdash  of what they dumped \emdash  isn't in the interior waiting to be annihilated when the interior stops existing. It's on the horizon. It's in the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
