\par "May I say one more thing. It is not physics."
\par "Please."
\par "You told Dr Bellew you were a physicist for eleven minutes in 1983." Von Wittenberg looked faintly embarrassed. "I was a history major. I intended to be a journalist. I worked on a political campaign. I came to physics late and by an unusual road, as did
