 Halpert, who came by no road at all." He picked up his pencil. "I mention it only because I notice that everybody who has come to talk to you this week arrived from somewhere else, and I do not think that is a coincid
ence, and I do not think it is a compliment either. It is simply that the people who ask what a thing }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid2584713\charrsid2584713 is}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
