\par "It isn't the catastrophe," said Stephanie Fainrose. "It's the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid2584713\charrsid2584713 disclosure}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid2584713\charrsid2584713 
. The thing is telling us everything they put into it, in the most scrambled possible handwriting, and it will stop when it has finished burning."
