which is strange twice over: entropy counts microstates, and a classical black hole was supposed to have almost none \emdash  and the count scales with }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid2584713\charrsid2584713 area}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
