, not volume, unlike every ordinary thermodynamic system. In 1996 Strominger and Vafa took a class of extremal charged black holes, constructed them from configurations of strings and branes, counted the microstates by straightforward combinatorics, and r
ecovered the Bekenstein\endash Hawking formula exactly, including the factor of 1/4. This remains the strongest concrete achievement of string theory and the only successful microscopic derivation of black hole entropy.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid2584713\charrsid2584713 Holography.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid2584713\charrsid2584713  The area law motivates the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
