\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls30\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10895145 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid16342456\charrsid16342456 The cat was an argument against a bad assumption, not a picture of nature.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16342456\charrsid16342456 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}There is no privileged instant at which a state becomes a settled fact; being unresolved is ordinary.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16342456\charrsid16342456 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Life sustains order by importing it and exporting disorder \emdash  the second law is paid, not evaded.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16342456\charrsid16342456 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Any promise of simplicity is a proposal to move complexity somewhere else; the only question is where, and whether anyone will say.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid16342456\charrsid16342456 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
